"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you move your crew member away from their post (e.g. if you need to send someone to the sickbay), their cards will be removed from the deck until they return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/7e85828a936cf47b6b8884dadf6236bb.poster.avif?t=1754649930\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/7e85828a936cf47b6b8884dadf6236bb.webm?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/7e85828a936cf47b6b8884dadf6236bb.mp4?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/f1e50c4674dcb75c9e9a50e66ec6f428.webp?t=1754649930\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/a743568335afb1dc5758d1addddc7c9d.poster.avif?t=1754649930\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/a743568335afb1dc5758d1addddc7c9d.webm?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/a743568335afb1dc5758d1addddc7c9d.mp4?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to decide where your crew need to be during combat. An engineer might be more useful boosting the reactor, getting some more juice out of the engines, or they might be needed for repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/6d3beacf5fbe9065fe192ba4a753fd51.webp?t=1754649930\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/e296766183d202647943cd104b0062e8.poster.avif?t=1754649930\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/e296766183d202647943cd104b0062e8.webm?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/e296766183d202647943cd104b0062e8.mp4?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As part of the game progression, you will use your resources to expand, upgrade and customize your ship. Decide whether your ship will be bristling with guns, fast and nippy or slow and tough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/8c8addba9bd0496e058974094e0c96e8.webp?t=1754649930\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/02440e052461e1c37b14d606668e44ff.poster.avif?t=1754649930\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/02440e052461e1c37b14d606668e44ff.webm?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/02440e052461e1c37b14d606668e44ff.mp4?t=1754649930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Command the remnants of Earth's fleet: from hunted to hunter. Build your strength, outsmart the Reptorians, and reclaim Earth. Your goal is to make your way back to Earth and defeat the Reptorian mothership. However, it won't be that easy, you'll need to build up your strength by upgrading your ship and improving your crew's skills and abilities (cards) if you want to stand a chance of beating the mothership. You will have to deal with events and challenges along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is a selection of cards you'll get to play with </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003770/extras/85bd630a9b988d0760dbb53a33ae471a.avif?t=1754649930\" /></div></p>",
